{"id":"bdb33be2414333e2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sldnf-safe-pair.md","title":"正规程序的安全 goal 对","display":"df-sldnf-safe-pair — 正规程序的安全 goal 对","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sldnf-safe-pair","aliases":["72-df-sldnf-safe-pair"],"display":"df-sldnf-safe-pair — 正规程序的安全 goal 对","depends_on":["[[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX Definition5.1.7, print664/PDF676","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"six source conditions and componentwise-union argument checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sldnf-safe-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sldnf-safe-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sldnf-safe-pair — 正规程序的安全 goal 对"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d5f212f0e342114\" href=\"?note=1d5f212f0e342114\" title=\"72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure\">72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX Definition5.1.7, print664/PDF676"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"six source conditions and componentwise-union argument checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d5f212f0e342114\" href=\"?note=1d5f212f0e342114\" title=\"72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure\">72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure</a> 的语言、代入及正规程序 P；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^+,S^-\\subseteq\\mathcal G\">\\(S^+,S^-\\subseteq\\mathcal G\\)</span>。U、V、A、B、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span>、σ 的论域沿用该节点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}\">\\(\\operatorname{vars}\\)</span> 为有限变量集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Safe}_P(S^+,S^-)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\bigwedge_{\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}}\\forall G\\in S^\\epsilon\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (G\\sigma\\in S^\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigwedge_{\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}}\\forall U,V,A\\ \\forall\\langle B,K\\rangle\\in P\\ \\forall\\sigma\\\n\\bigl[A=B\\sigma\\land U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in S^\\epsilon\n\\Rightarrow U^\\frown(K\\sigma)^\\frown V\\in S^\\epsilon\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\langle A_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\\in(\\mathcal A^+)^k\\\n\\bigl[\\langle-A_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\\in S^+\\Rightarrow\n\\forall i&lt;k\\ (\\operatorname{vars}(A_i)=\\varnothing\\land\\langle A_i\\rangle\\in S^-)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V,A\\ (U^\\frown\\langle-A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in S^-\\Rightarrow\\langle A\\rangle\\in S^+),\\\\\nS^+_P&amp;:=\\bigcup\\{S^+:\\exists S^-\\ \\operatorname{Safe}_P(S^+,S^-)\\},\\quad\nS^-_P:=\\bigcup\\{S^-:\\exists S^+\\ \\operatorname{Safe}_P(S^+,S^-)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Safe}_P(S^+,S^-)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\bigwedge_{\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}}\\forall G\\in S^\\epsilon\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (G\\sigma\\in S^\\epsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigwedge_{\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}}\\forall U,V,A\\ \\forall\\langle B,K\\rangle\\in P\\ \\forall\\sigma\\\n\\bigl[A=B\\sigma\\land U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in S^\\epsilon\n\\Rightarrow U^\\frown(K\\sigma)^\\frown V\\in S^\\epsilon\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\langle A_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\\in(\\mathcal A^+)^k\\\n\\bigl[\\langle-A_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\\in S^+\\Rightarrow\n\\forall i&lt;k\\ (\\operatorname{vars}(A_i)=\\varnothing\\land\\langle A_i\\rangle\\in S^-)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V,A\\ (U^\\frown\\langle-A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in S^-\\Rightarrow\\langle A\\rangle\\in S^+),\\\\\nS^+_P&amp;:=\\bigcup\\{S^+:\\exists S^-\\ \\operatorname{Safe}_P(S^+,S^-)\\},\\quad\nS^-_P:=\\bigcup\\{S^-:\\exists S^+\\ \\operatorname{Safe}_P(S^+,S^-)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前两行分别合并源 A1/B1 和 A2/B2；第三、四行分别是 A3、B3。空对安全；任意安全对族的分量并仍满足全部条件，因为每个触发前件来自某个具体安全对。这给出最大安全对，未把它当作任意程序的全部 ground goals。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure","status":"resolved","id":"1d5f212f0e342114","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure","status":"resolved","id":"1d5f212f0e342114","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] 的语言、代入及正规程序 P；$S^+,S^-\\subseteq\\mathcal G$。U、V、A、B、$A_i$、σ 的论域沿用该节点；$\\operatorname{vars}$ 为有限变量集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S^+,S^-\\subseteq\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"A_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vars}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Safe}_P(S^+,S^-)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&\\bigwedge_{\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}}\\forall G\\in S^\\epsilon\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (G\\sigma\\in S^\\epsilon)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigwedge_{\\epsilon\\in\\{+,-\\}}\\forall U,V,A\\ \\forall\\langle B,K\\rangle\\in P\\ \\forall\\sigma\\\n\\bigl[A=B\\sigma\\land U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in S^\\epsilon\n\\Rightarrow U^\\frown(K\\sigma)^\\frown V\\in S^\\epsilon\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\langle A_i\\rangle_{i<k}\\in(\\mathcal A^+)^k\\\n\\bigl[\\langle-A_i\\rangle_{i<k}\\in S^+\\Rightarrow\n\\forall i<k\\ (\\operatorname{vars}(A_i)=\\varnothing\\land\\langle A_i\\rangle\\in S^-)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U,V,A\\ (U^\\frown\\langle-A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in S^-\\Rightarrow\\langle A\\rangle\\in S^+),\\\\\nS^+_P&:=\\bigcup\\{S^+:\\exists S^-\\ \\operatorname{Safe}_P(S^+,S^-)\\},\\quad\nS^-_P:=\\bigcup\\{S^-:\\exists S^+\\ \\operatorname{Safe}_P(S^+,S^-)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2197,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-550","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld